<title>UK: Luke says back as DMG emerging mkt research head.</title>
<headline>Luke says back as DMG emerging mkt research head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paul Luke said he had returned to Deutsche Morgan Grenfell as head of emerging market research and strategy for both fixed income and equities.</p>
<p>He resigned from the bank for personal reasons in March as director of emerging markets strategy and trading.</p>
<p>Luke told Reuters DMG planned to launch an array of new products, including quarterly economic forecasts and a regular asset allocation publication. It is also building up East Europe and setting up a corporate Eurobond analytics team.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
